 - **Peacocking:** you may place the Large Bird Aviary before upgrading Build. **Your zoo must not already have an Aviary, and there must be a legal site.** Other placement restrictions still apply, including Build II for upgrade-marked map spaces.
 
 **Multiplier.**
-- **Placement:** place a gained token immediately onto the named Action card. A **bonus-tile Multiplier may go on any Action card, including Animals**.
+**Place a gained Multiplier immediately according to its source:**
+
+| Reward source | Where to place the token |
+|---|---|
+| A reward naming a specific Action card | Put it on that named Action card. |
+| Bonus tile | Choose **any of your Action cards, including Animals**. |
+
 - **Two executions:** on its next use, you may execute that action twice in succession at the same base strength. Move the Action card only after both executions.
 - **X-tokens:** each X-token boosts only one execution.
 - **Additional Multipliers:** each additional token used adds one execution; two tokens permit up to three actions, not four.
